    {
      "parameters": {
        "promptType": "define",
        "text": "=Analyze the following invoice text and extract the required information.\n\nINVOICE TEXT:\n{{ $json.text }}\n\nExtract:\nvendor_name\ninvoice_number\ninvoice_date\ndue_date\nsubtotal\ntax\ntotal_amount\ncurrency\n\nThen assign a risk_level:\nLOW, MEDIUM, or HIGH.\n\nReturn ONLY valid JSON in exactly this format:\n\n{\n  \"vendor_name\": \"\",\n  \"invoice_number\": \"\",\n  \"invoice_date\": \"\",\n  \"due_date\": \"\",\n  \"subtotal\": 0,\n  \"tax\": 0,\n  \"total_amount\": 0,\n  \"currency\": \"\",\n  \"risk_level\": \"\"\n}\n\nIf a value is missing, use null.\nDo not add any extra fields.\nReturn JSON only.\nIMPORTANT:\nNever return null values.\nIf a value is missing, return an empty string \"\" for text fields and 0 for numeric fields.\nReturn ONLY the fields defined in the output parser.\nDo not return risk_score or reason.",
        "hasOutputParser": true,
        "options": {
          "systemMessage": "You are a helpful assistant\nYou are an AI Invoice Analysis Agent.\n\nAnalyze the invoice text received from the previous node.\n\nExtract:\n- vendor_name\n- invoice_number\n- invoice_date\n- due_date\n- subtotal\n- tax\n- total_amount\n- currency\n\nThen calculate a risk level:\nLOW, MEDIUM, or HIGH.\n\nReturn ONLY JSON in this format:\n\n{\n  \"vendor_name\": \"\",\n  \"invoice_number\": \"\",\n  \"invoice_date\": \"\",\n  \"due_date\": \"\",\n  \"subtotal\": 0,\n  \"tax\": 0,\n  \"total_amount\": 0,\n  \"currency\": \"\",\n  \"risk_level\": \"\",\n  \"risk_score\": 0,\n  \"reason\": \"\"\n}"
        }
      },
